6. Pipes: “And Then”
|&gt; (modern) and %&gt;% (older tidyverse) chain operations together:

counties |&gt;
  filter(moe_pct &gt; 10) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(moe_pct)) |&gt;
  select(NAME, moe_pct)

Reads as: start with counties → filter → arrange → select. Equivalent to writing separate step1, step2, step3 objects, but more compact.
